Commenced development of the parsing layer for the JioMart project, focused on mapping raw JSON API responses into structured, database-ready product attributes.

Investigated and verified the JioMart "Price" API endpoint, ensuring accurate retrieval and cleaning of base prices, promotional discounts, and currency formatting.

Validated the "Rating and Review" API endpoints, ensuring reliable mapping of aggregate customer ratings and review volumes to each product record.

Refined and finalized the parser codebase, implementing comprehensive error handling to manage schema variations and ensure consistent data integrity.

Executed a sample data export from the JioMart database, confirming that the output format and data quality align with project schema requirements.


